    "shortDescription": "<p>GREE Wall Type Air Conditioner</p><p>Model: GS-12XARV32 PRO (Inverter)</p><p>Capacity: 1.0 TON&nbsp;</p>",
    "description": "<p><strong>1. Performance &amp; Compressor Technology</strong></p><p><strong>G-Boost Inverter Compressor:</strong> Built around a heavy-duty <strong>T3 Tropical Compressor</strong>, this unit is engineered specifically for extreme climates. It uses G-Boost technology to prevent \"thermal throttling,\" ensuring the AC provides stable, consistent cooling even when outdoor ambient temperatures reach up to <strong>68°C</strong>.</p><p><strong>Ultra-Wide Voltage Operation (130V – 275V):</strong> The internal electronics are designed to absorb and stabilize volatile power fluctuations without requiring an external voltage stabilizer. This keeps the compressor running safely during deep voltage sags or sudden spikes.</p><p><strong>Eco-Friendly R32 Refrigerant:</strong> Utilizes low-GWP (Global Warming Potential) R32 refrigerant, which delivers higher thermodynamic efficiency and reduced energy consumption compared to older refrigerants.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>2. Artificial Intelligence &amp; Smart Integration</strong></p><p><strong>G-Learning Algorithm:</strong> Driven by a dedicated onboard AI chip, the AC actively tracks and learns your local environment, ambient humidity, and routine usage habits. It optimizes its inverter control scheme dynamically, reducing annual power consumption by up to <strong>10% to 20%</strong> compared to standard inverter units.</p><p><strong>Dual Connectivity (Wi-Fi + Bluetooth):</strong> Seamlessly pairs with smart devices via Bluetooth for instant setup and offers full Wi-Fi control for remote access, Scheduling, and voice control compatibility (Google Assistant and Amazon Alexa).</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>3. Comprehensive 6-Stage Air Purification</strong></p><p>The Airy series emphasizes indoor air quality (IAQ) through a specialized multi-tier filtration and sterilization pathway:</p><p><strong>Stage 1 &amp; 2 (Physical Filtration):</strong> High-density inlet air filtration to trap large airborne particles, pollen, and dust. Designed for easy removal and cleaning.</p><p><strong>Stage 3 (Air Inlet UVC Sterilization):</strong> A built-in UV-C light emitter sanitizes incoming air, neutralizing bacteria and viruses right at the intake stage.</p><p><strong>Stage 4 (Deep Evaporator Cleaning):</strong> Periodically runs an automated defrosting, frosting, and high-temperature drying cycle to wash away hidden mold and grime from the internal evaporator.</p><p><strong>Stage 5 (Cold Plasma Air Outlet Purification):</strong> Generates specialized ions at the air discharge point to actively break down surface pathogens and eliminate stubborn odors.</p><p><strong>Stage 6 (Outdoor Unit Self-Cleaning):</strong> Reverses the fan or utilizes targeted cycles on the outdoor unit (ODU) to clear dust and debris away from the condenser fins, preserving optimal heat exchange over time.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>4. Airflow &amp; Comfort Design</strong></p><p><strong>Independent Smart Dehumidification:</strong> Monitors room climate metrics to maintain a personalized humidity level (adjustable between <strong>30% and 80%</strong>). This provides a crisp, comfortable indoor feel without overcooling the space or drying out your skin.</p><p><strong>4-Way Long-Distance Air Throw:</strong> Delivers an expansive airflow pattern with an effective air throw distance of up to <strong>15.5 meters</strong>, ensuring uniform temperature distribution across large or deep rooms.</p><p><strong>Ultra-Quiet Performance:</strong> Features modified internal aerodynamics that drop the lowest operational fan speed sound pressure levels down to a whisper-quiet <strong>19 dB to 25 dB</strong>.</p><p><strong>Closed Dustproof Chassis:</strong> The physical frame features a sleek, tight-sealing front panel mechanism that completely closes when shut down, preventing settling dust and insects from entering the internal assembly.</p>",
