    "shortDescription": "<p>GREE Wall Type Air Conditioner</p><p>Model: GSH-12XCLV32 (Inverter)</p><p>Capacity: 1.0 TON (Hot &amp; Cool)</p>",
    "description": "<p>The <strong>GREE Clivia Split Series</strong> is a premium line of smart inverter air conditioners (typically offering both <strong>Hot &amp; Cool</strong> functionality). Its defining characteristic is being the world’s first residential AC series integrated with <strong>G-AI (Artificial Intelligence)</strong> to optimize energy consumption based on user behavior and environmental factors.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Key Features Breakdown</strong></p><p><strong>&nbsp;1. Smart AI &amp; Efficiency Technology</strong></p><ul><li><strong>G-AI Technology:</strong> An intelligent algorithm that dynamically learns user habits and monitors ambient temperature, room size, and humidity. It alters its operation strategy to maintain maximum comfort while saving up to <strong>10% of energy consumption annually</strong>.&nbsp;</li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><ul><li><strong>Inverter Pro Technology:</strong> High-efficiency dual rotary inverter system ensures rapid cooling/heating with smooth, stable temperature control, reducing overall electricity draws significantly.&nbsp;</li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><ul><li><strong>Eco Mode &amp; Low Watt Start:</strong> Optimizes performance for energy conservation and allows stable startup even under voltage fluctuations (Ultra-Wide Voltage Operation: roughly 165V–265V).&nbsp;</li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>2. Comfort &amp; Airflow Control</strong></p><ul><li><strong>7 Fan Speeds:</strong> Offers highly customizable airflow rates (from subtle, quiet breezes to powerful high-volume circulation).&nbsp;</li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><ul><li><strong>2-Way / 4-Way Auto Swing:</strong> Distributes conditioned air evenly into every corner of the room to eliminate hotspots.&nbsp;</li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><ul><li><strong>Smart Humidity Control:</strong> Includes a continuous dehumidification function designed to comfortably adjust room moisture curves, which can even assist with tasks like indoor clothes drying.&nbsp;</li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><ul><li><strong>I-Feel Feature:</strong> A sensor embedded in the remote control measures the ambient temperature exactly where you are sitting, adjusting the unit's output to match your immediate location.&nbsp;</li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><ul><li><strong>Ultra-Quiet Mode:</strong> Lowers operational decibel levels significantly for a peaceful sleep or work environment.&nbsp;</li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>3. Cleanliness &amp; Health Tech</strong></p><ul><li><strong>4-Step Indoor Unit (IDU) Self-Cleaning:</strong> Runs through a thorough internal maintenance process to keep the air pure:&nbsp;<ol><li><i>Dust Removal</i>&nbsp;</li><li><i>Condensation</i></li><li><i>Frosting</i></li><li><i>Defrosting</i></li></ol></li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><ul><li><strong>Outdoor Unit (ODU) Self-Cleaning:</strong> Removes accumulated outdoor dust and moisture automatically to maintain system performance over time.&nbsp;</li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><ul><li><strong>UVC Pro Sterilization / Cold Plasma:</strong> Continuously irradiates the evaporator and internal airflow to neutralize bacteria, mold spores, and viruses before the air is circulated back into the room.&nbsp;</li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>4. Connectivity &amp; Maintenance</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Built-in Wi-Fi Control:</strong> Seamlessly connects to smartphones via a dedicated app for complete remote control, scheduling, and smart home eco-system pairing.&nbsp;</li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><ul><li><strong>Hidden LED Display:</strong> Sleek, modern display layout on the indoor chassis with brightness controls so it won't disrupt you at night.&nbsp;</li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><ul><li><strong>Comprehensive Anti-Corrosion Protection:</strong> Utilizes <strong>Golden Fin</strong> / 100% copper condensers designed to withstand harsh outdoor weathering and prevent early rusting, significantly increasing the unit's lifespan.&nbsp;</li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>5. General Technical Overview</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Capacity Variants:</strong> Available in 1.0 Ton (12,000 BTU), 1.5 Ton (18,000 BTU), and 2.0 Ton (24,000 BTU) variants.</li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><ul><li><strong>Refrigerant:</strong> Eco-friendly, low global warming potential <strong>R32</strong> gas.&nbsp;</li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><ul><li><strong>Turbo Cooling:</strong> Features a 60-second quick cooling/heating boost when you first power on the machine.&nbsp;</li></ul>",
