    "shortDescription": "<p>GREE Air Conditioner Zeno Series</p><p>Model: GS-24XZNA3V (Inverter)</p><p>Capacity: 2.0 TON&nbsp;</p>",
    "description": "<p>The <strong>Gree Zeno Series Split Inverter Air Conditioner</strong> is a premium, high-efficiency smart AC lineup known for its advanced air purification, robust low-voltage operation, and smart connectivity. Powered by Gree's signature <strong>G10 Inverter technology</strong>, it is designed to save up to 60% on electricity while maintaining a highly stable and comfortable room temperature.&nbsp;</p><p><strong>GREE Zeno Series AC Description</strong><br>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>❄️ Smart &amp; Powerful Cooling</strong></p><p>GREE Zeno Inverter Series provides fast and stable cooling performance with advanced inverter technology and intelligent temperature control. The AC can quickly cool rooms while reducing electricity consumption.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>🧠 Smart Features</strong></p><ul><li>Turbo Cooling</li><li>Normal Sleep Mode</li><li>I-Feel Sensor</li><li>Auto Restart</li><li>Auto Fan&nbsp;</li><li>Self Diagnosis System</li><li>Auto Swing(Vertical Auto Swing)</li><li>Auto Swing(Horizontal Auto Swing)</li><li>Cold Plasma</li><li>Turbo Cooling</li><li>Soft Start</li><li>Low Voltage Startup</li><li>WIFI Connectivity&nbsp;</li></ul><p>These smart functions improve comfort and convenience for daily use.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>🛡️ Durable &amp; Reliable Design</strong></p><p>GREE Zeno Inverter Series comes with:</p><ul><li>Rust resistant condenser</li><li>Wide voltage operation</li><li>Outdoor self-cleaning technology</li></ul><p>This makes the AC suitable for Bangladesh’s hot, humid, and dusty weather conditions.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>🔇 Quiet Operation</strong></p><p>The indoor unit operates with very low noise for comfortable sleeping and office use. Some models operate as low as around 38–50 dB.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul><li>Powerful inverter cooling technology</li><li>Energy-saving performance</li><li>Elegant modern design</li><li>Healthy air purification system</li><li>Low noise operation</li><li>Turbo cooling function</li><li>Smart temperature control</li><li>Auto cleaning and self-diagnosis system</li><li>Suitable for all-season comfort</li><li>Multi Speeds</li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The GREE Zeno Series delivers a perfect balance of performance, comfort, energy efficiency, and modern lifestyle convenience.</p>",
