    "shortDescription": "<p>HAIKO Inverter</p><p>Model: HA-18GCV32</p><p>Capacity: 1.5 TON</p>",
    "description": "<p>The HAIKO Inverter Series air conditioner is designed with modern cooling technology, energy efficiency, and healthy air purification features. It is one of Electromart's newer premium AC series introduced in Bangladesh with advanced technologies.</p><p><strong>HAIKO Inverter Series AC Description</strong><br>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>❄️ Smart &amp; Powerful Cooling</strong></p><p><strong>HAIKO Inverter&nbsp;</strong> Series provides fast and stable cooling performance with advanced technology and intelligent temperature control. The AC can quickly cool rooms while reducing electricity consumption.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>🧠 Smart Features</strong></p><ul><li>Turbo Cooling</li><li>Normal Sleep Mode</li><li>I-Feel Sensor</li><li>Auto Restart</li><li>Auto Fan&nbsp;</li><li>Self Diagnosis System</li><li>Auto Swing(Vertical Auto Swing)</li></ul><p>These smart functions improve comfort and convenience for daily use.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>🛡️ Durable &amp; Reliable Design</strong></p><p>HAIKO Inverter &nbsp;Series comes with:</p><ul><li>Rust resistant condenser</li><li>Wide voltage operation</li><li>Outdoor self-cleaning technology</li></ul><p>This makes the AC suitable for Bangladesh’s hot, humid, and dusty weather conditions.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>🔇 Quiet Operation</strong></p><p>The indoor unit operates with very low noise for comfortable sleeping and office use. Some models operate as low as around 38–50 dB.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul><li>Energy-saving performance</li><li>Elegant modern design</li><li>Healthy air purification system</li><li>Low noise operation</li><li>Turbo cooling function</li><li>Smart temperature control</li><li>Auto cleaning and self-diagnosis system</li><li>Suitable for all-season comfort</li><li>Multi Speeds</li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>HAIKO Inverter&nbsp;</strong>Series delivers a perfect balance of performance, comfort, energy efficiency, and modern lifestyle convenience.</p>",
