    "description": "<p>The HAIKO Non-Inverter Series Air Conditioner is designed to deliver powerful cooling performance, reliable operation, and long-lasting durability. Built with advanced cooling technology and premium components, it offers comfortable indoor cooling for homes, offices, and commercial spaces.</p><p>❄️ Powerful &amp; Consistent Cooling</p><p>HAIKO Non-Inverter Series provides strong and efficient cooling to quickly reduce room temperature even during extreme summer conditions. Its high-performance compressor ensures stable and dependable operation throughout the day.</p><p><strong>🧠 Smart Features</strong></p><ul><li>Turbo Cooling</li><li>Sleep Mode</li><li>Auto Restart</li><li>Auto Fan Speed Control</li><li>Timer Function</li><li>Self Diagnosis System</li><li>Vertical Auto Swing</li><li>LED Hidden Display</li><li>R410A Refrigerant&nbsp;</li></ul><p>These intelligent features provide enhanced comfort, convenience, and easy operation.</p><p><strong>🛡️ Durable &amp; Reliable Design</strong></p><p>HAIKO Non-Inverter Series comes with:</p><ul><li>100% Copper Condenser</li><li>Golden Fin Protection</li><li>Rust Resistant Components</li><li>Wide Voltage Operation</li><li>High-Efficiency Heat Exchange System</li></ul><p>These features ensure long-lasting performance and make the AC suitable for Bangladesh’s hot and humid climate.</p><p><strong>🔇 Comfortable Operation</strong></p><p>The unit is engineered for smooth and quiet performance, creating a comfortable environment for sleeping, working, and daily living.</p><ul><li>Key Features</li><li>Powerful Cooling Performance</li><li>100% Copper Condenser</li><li>Golden Fin Protection</li><li>Energy Efficient Operation</li><li>Turbo Cooling Function</li><li>Low Noise Operation</li><li>Auto Restart Function</li><li>Self Diagnosis System</li><li>Washable Air Filter</li><li>Smart Air Distribution</li><li>Elegant Modern Design</li><li>Multi-Speed Fan Control</li></ul><p>HAIKO Non-Inverter Series delivers reliable cooling, durability, comfort, and value, making it an ideal choice for everyday air conditioning needs.</p>",
