    "shortDescription": "Brand Hollow Tech Model U6 Filtration Stage 5 Stages Machine Type Direct Flow Dispensed Water Type Room Temperature (Normal) Technology Ultrafiltration Membrane Type Hollow Fiber Membrane Dimension 15Lx13Hx4W Inch Weight 3 KG Warranty 1 Year Electricity N/A Origin China",
    "description": "<h1 dir=\"ltr\">Hollow Tech U6 Water Purifier | Direct Flow Water Filter</h1>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Hollow Tech U6 Water Purifier . The Hollowtech U6 Water Purifier is designed and used with the latest Hollow fiber membrane technology to produce great tasting water that is clean, pure and healthy for drinking. It uses a 5 stage filtration process that removes up to 99% of lead, arsenic, asbestos, calcium, chlorine (taste and smell), cadmium, mercury, benzene, asbestos and more. Essential for every domestics and commercial, this product meets the essential standards of quality, durability and maximum utility. Customer satisfaction is 100% guaranteed. You will get this brand new and higher quality water purifier from Heron Water Purifier online shop at an affordable price.</p>\n<p style=\"font-weight: 400\">Hollow Tech U6 Purifier Filtering Process</p>\n<p style=\"font-weight: 400\"><b>Stage 1: Dirt and Sand Reduction</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400\"> &#8211; Its one type PP filters which remove dirt and harmful particles and chemicals from the water. It is the second water filtering process which plays an important role in removing dirt particles in the initial stage. </span></p>\n<p style=\"font-weight: 400\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">The dirt and sand reduction filter life time is 3 months. That is, the filter should be changed every three months. But it depends on the water quality.</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-weight: 400\"><b>Stage 2: Taste and Odor Filter </b><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">&#8211; Taste and odor filter also known as taste and odor removal filter. It removes residual molecules that cause bad taste in water, which purifies your water to provide better tasting water.</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-weight: 400\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">The taste and odor filter life time is 6 months. That is, the taste and odor filter should be changed every six months. But it depends on the water quality.</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-weight: 400\"><b>Stage 3: Hollow Fiber UF Membrane </b><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">&#8211; Ultrafiltration or UF is a membrane filtration process, making use of reverse osmosis. It is used in the treatment of alternative water sources, such as wastewater, brackish water, and groundwater, among others. And for the production of potable water. These membranes exclude impurities that come in the 0.02 to 0.05-micron range.</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-weight: 400\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">The Hollow Fiber UF Membrane life time is 2 to 3 years. That is, the Hollow Fiber Membrane should be changed at least two/three years later. But it depends on the water quality.</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-weight: 400\"><b>Stage 4:  CTO Filter (Net Carbon Filter) </b><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">&#8211; CTO water filter or Net Carbon filter, is used in water filtration systems to remove chlorine, chemical, bad taste, and odors from drinking water. It is the second water filtering process which plays an important role in removing dirt particles and making the water pure .</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-weight: 400\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">The CTO filter life time is 6 months. That is, the CTO filter should be changed every six months. But it depends on the water quality. </span></p>\n<p style=\"font-weight: 400\"><b>Stage 5: GAC/UDF Filter</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400\"> &#8211; A GAC filter, also known as a UDF filter, is a device used to remove impurities and pollutants and other bad chemicals from water and make water 99% pure.</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-weight: 400\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">The GAC filter life time is 6 months. That is, the GAC filter should be changed every six months. But it depends on the water quality. </span></p>",
