    "description": "<h2>Hisense 28 Liters Convection Mwo With Easy-clean Ss Cavity Push Door (HMBC2809DSC) – Full Specifications</h2>\n<table id=\"product-spec-table\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"ferdous-table\" rowspan=\"3\" width=\"130\">Product Specification</td>\n<td width=\"205\">Capacity</td>\n<td width=\"439\">28L Conv. &amp; Grill</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Hisense Model</td>\n<td>HMBC2809DSC</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Product Name</td>\n<td> 28L Convection MWO with Easy-Clean SS Cavity (Push Door)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"ferdous-table\" rowspan=\"9\" width=\"130\"> Basic Specification</td>\n<td width=\"205\">Microwave Output Power</td>\n<td width=\"439\">900W</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"205\">Grill Power</td>\n<td width=\"439\">1200W</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"205\">Conv. Power</td>\n<td width=\"439\">2200W</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"205\">Power Source</td>\n<td width=\"439\">220-240v 50hz</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"205\">Display Specification</td>\n<td>White</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"205\">Max. Cooking Time</td>\n<td width=\"439\">60 min</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"205\">Power Level</td>\n<td width=\"439\">10 Power Level<br />\n(10%,20%, 30%…. 100%)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"205\">Clock Control(12/24Hrs)</td>\n<td width=\"439\">Yes</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"205\">Power Cord Plug Type</td>\n<td width=\"439\">South Africa Plug</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"130\">Product Dimensions</td>\n<td width=\"205\">Product Dimensions W*D*H (mm)</td>\n<td width=\"439\">W510*D410*H303</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"ferdous-table\" rowspan=\"2\" width=\"130\">Accessory Dimensions</td>\n<td width=\"205\">Glass Turntable*1</td>\n<td width=\"439\">Diameter:315mm</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"205\">Grill Rack</td>\n<td width=\"439\">Yes</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"ferdous-table\" rowspan=\"5\" width=\"130\">Mutual Function</td>\n<td width=\"205\">Clock</td>\n<td width=\"439\">Yes</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"205\">Timer</td>\n<td width=\"439\">Yes</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"205\">+30<br />\nSEC</td>\n<td width=\"439\">Yes</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"205\">Turntable Off</td>\n<td width=\"439\">No</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"205\">Lock</td>\n<td width=\"439\">Yes</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2>Hisense 28 Liters Convection Mwo With Easy-clean Ss Cavity Push Door (HMBC2809DSC)</h2>\n<p>This <strong>Hisense HMBC2809DSC 28 Liters Convection <a href=\"/category/microwave-oven\">Microwave Oven</a></strong> sturdy stainless steel cavity is easy to clean and stain resistant, assuring long-term performance. The sleek white LED display gives clear readability and includes clock control (12/24 hours), a 60-minute cooking timer, and a +30-second rapid start option. It also has ten adjustable power settings (10% to 100%), allowing you to precisely manage your cooking process. The Hisense microwave combines safety and convenience. The child lock feature keeps your kitchen secure for the whole family, while the accompanying 315mm glass turntable and grill rack expand your cooking options. This appliance, with its South Africa plug type, is designed to easily suit your household demands.</p>\n<p>The <strong>Hisense HMBC2809DSC</strong> has three flexible cooking functions: microwave, grill, and convection, allowing you to bake, roast, grill, and reheat all in the same device. Its 900W microwave output, 1200W grill power, and 2200W convection heating ensure that your foods cook evenly and rapidly, saving you time and energy. Whether you’re making crispy grilled snacks, soft baked cakes, or reheating leftovers, this microwave consistently produces excellent results.</p>",
