    "shortDescription": "Key Features 4 Rotisserie + Convection 60-Minute Timer Adjustable Temperature Control 4 Stainless Steel Heating Element Power: 1800W 3 Level Heater Settings Warranty 1 year service warranty",
    "description": "<h2>Sharp 42L Electric Oven (EO42K3) – Detailed Specifications</h2>\n<table class=\"specification-section__table border-top pt-3 mt-4\" width=\"552\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"proDetailLabel\">Title:</td>\n<td class=\"proDetailValue\">Sharp Electric Oven (EO42K3)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"proDetailLabel\">Brand:</td>\n<td class=\"proDetailValue\">SHARP</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"proDetailLabel\">Colour</td>\n<td class=\"proDetailValue\">Black</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"proDetailLabel\">Capacity</td>\n<td class=\"proDetailValue\">42 Ltr</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"proDetailLabel\">Country of Origin</td>\n<td class=\"proDetailValue\">Japan</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"proDetailLabel\">Watt</td>\n<td class=\"proDetailValue\">1800 W</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"proDetailLabel\">Features</td>\n<td class=\"proDetailValue\">With a big capacity of 42L and 1800w, this electric oven ensures a faster cooking experience than the rest of the available options. If you are always busy and need something that can cook food as fast as possible, this is the oven made for you. It also has a 60 minutes Timer with a ring bell so when your food is done, even when watching TV, preparing other food, or playing with your children, you can hear and smell your breakfast/lunch/dinner right away!</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"proDetailLabel\">Dimensions</td>\n<td class=\"proDetailValue\">62.0 x 45.0 x 43.5 Inche</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"proDetailLabel\">Model</td>\n<td class=\"proDetailValue\">EO42K3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"proDetailLabel\">Control Panel</td>\n<td class=\"proDetailValue\">Mechanical 3 Knob control</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"proDetailLabel\">Function</td>\n<td class=\"proDetailValue\">Adjustable Temperature Control<br />\nRotisserie function<br />\nConvection function</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"proDetailLabel\">Material</td>\n<td class=\"proDetailValue\">Stainless Steel</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"proDetailLabel\">Frequency</td>\n<td class=\"proDetailValue\">50Hz</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"proDetailLabel\">Input Voltage</td>\n<td class=\"proDetailValue\">230-240V</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"proDetailLabel\">Product Weight</td>\n<td class=\"proDetailValue\">12 Kg</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"proDetailLabel\">Temperature Range</td>\n<td class=\"proDetailValue\">Up to 250°</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"proDetailLabel\">Handle</td>\n<td class=\"proDetailValue\">Yes.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"proDetailLabel\">Handle Material</td>\n<td class=\"proDetailValue\">Stainless Steel</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"proDetailLabel\">Control Method</td>\n<td class=\"proDetailValue\">Analog (manual)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"proDetailLabel\">Door Material</td>\n<td class=\"proDetailValue\">‎Tempered Glass</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"proDetailLabel\">Power Levels</td>\n<td class=\"proDetailValue\">3 Level</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"proDetailLabel\">Grill</td>\n<td class=\"proDetailValue\">Yes.(Grill Rack)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"proDetailLabel\">Timer</td>\n<td class=\"proDetailValue\">60-Minute</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"proDetailLabel\">Clock &amp; Timer Mode</td>\n<td class=\"proDetailValue\">Yes.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"proDetailLabel\">Child Lock</td>\n<td class=\"proDetailValue\">Yes.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"proDetailLabel\">heating system</td>\n<td class=\"proDetailValue\">4 Stainless Steel Heating Elements</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"proDetailLabel\">Type of oven</td>\n<td class=\"proDetailValue\">Microwave Oven</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"proDetailLabel\">Control Mode</td>\n<td class=\"proDetailValue\">Manual</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"proDetailLabel\">Oven Technology</td>\n<td class=\"proDetailValue\">Solo microwave.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"proDetailLabel\">Door Opening Mechanism</td>\n<td class=\"proDetailValue\">Manual</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"proDetailLabel\">Door Opening Type</td>\n<td class=\"proDetailValue\">Pull on</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"proDetailLabel\">Door Type</td>\n<td class=\"proDetailValue\">Glass Finish Door</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2>Sharp 42L Electric Oven (EO42K3) – Efficient, Spacious, and Family-Ready</h2>\n<p>Imagine preparing a roast, baking cookies, and grilling vegetables all at once. The Sharp 42L <a href=\"/category/microwave-oven\">Electric Oven</a> (EO42K3) is an excellent combination of power and versatility for Bangladeshi families wishing to up their cooking game without compromising counter space.</p>\n<p>This modern <a href=\"/category/microwave-oven\">kitchen appliance</a> blends performance, style, and convenience to make everyday cooking effortless.</p>",
