    "description": "<h2>Sharp 24 Liters Top Control Solo Microwave Oven R-2235H(R) – Full Specifications</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Capacity (Liter): 24 Liter</li>\n<li>Output Power (Microwave): 800 W</li>\n<li>Microwave: Yes</li>\n<li>Power Required (Max): 1200~1250 W</li>\n<li>Control: Key Membrane</li>\n<li>Door Opening: Hidden Pocket Handle Type</li>\n<li>Child Lock: Yes</li>\n<li>Sensor: Yes</li>\n<li>Sensor Menu: Sensor Cook (Instant Noodles, Vegetables, Rice) / Sensor Reheat</li>\n<li>Auto Menu: Beverages (1/2/3/4 Cups)</li>\n<li>Turntable (mm): 270 mm / glass</li>\n<li>Inside Dimensions (W X H X D) mm: 317 x 348 x 221</li>\n<li>Outside Dimensions (W X H X D) mm: 485 x 408 x 293</li>\n<li>Weight (kg): 13.1</li>\n<li>Country of Origin: Japan</li>\n<li>Country of Assemble: China</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Sharp 24L Solo Microwave Oven R-2235H(R) — Everyday cooking, no drama</h2>\n<p>If you want a countertop appliance that actually makes life easier without asking for attention, the <a href=\"/category/microwave-ovensolo/\"><strong>Sharp 24L Solo Microwave Oven R-2235H(R)</strong></a> is exactly that kind of clean, dependable tool. This Top Control Solo Microwave Oven packs an 800 W microwave output into a compact 24L capacity, so whether you’re reheating leftovers, making instant noodles, or warming a cup of tea, it does the job fast and without fuss. For small families, students, or anyone who wants a no-nonsense microwave oven, the R-2235H(R) hits the sweet spot between power and simplicity.</p>",
