    "description": "<h3 data-start=\"146\" data-end=\"219\"><strong data-start=\"150\" data-end=\"217\">Eva Pure Geyser – Safe, Efficient &amp; Reliable Hot Water Solution</strong></h3>\n<p data-start=\"221\" data-end=\"474\">Experience instant comfort with the <strong data-start=\"257\" data-end=\"276\">Eva Pure Geyser</strong>, designed to deliver reliable hot water for your home or office. Built with advanced heating technology, this geyser ensures <strong data-start=\"402\" data-end=\"457\">fast heating, energy efficiency, and maximum safety</strong> for daily use.</p>\n<p data-start=\"476\" data-end=\"747\">Its <strong data-start=\"480\" data-end=\"502\">durable inner tank</strong>, <strong data-start=\"504\" data-end=\"537\">automatic temperature control</strong>, and <strong data-start=\"543\" data-end=\"566\">overheat protection</strong> make it the perfect choice for modern households. Whether for your kitchen or bathroom, the Eva Pure Geyser provides consistent performance even in low water pressure conditions.</p>\n<h4 data-start=\"749\" data-end=\"773\"><strong data-start=\"754\" data-end=\"771\">Key Features:</strong></h4>\n<ul data-start=\"774\" data-end=\"1075\">\n<li data-start=\"774\" data-end=\"833\">\n<p data-start=\"776\" data-end=\"833\">✅ Rapid water heating with energy-efficient performance</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"834\" data-end=\"879\">\n<p data-start=\"836\" data-end=\"879\">✅ Durable inner tank for long-lasting use</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"880\" data-end=\"930\">\n<p data-start=\"882\" data-end=\"930\">✅ Automatic thermostat and overheat protection</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"931\" data-end=\"977\">\n<p data-start=\"933\" data-end=\"977\">✅ Elegant design suitable for any interior</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"978\" data-end=\"1045\">\n<p data-start=\"980\" data-end=\"1045\">✅ Available in multiple capacities</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1046\" data-end=\"1075\">\n<p data-start=\"1048\" data-end=\"1075\">✅ 7-year replacement warranty</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"1077\" data-end=\"1219\">Enjoy dependable hot water every day with the <strong data-start=\"1123\" data-end=\"1142\">Eva Pure Geyser</strong> — where <strong data-start=\"1151\" data-end=\"1176\">comfort meets quality</strong>, exclusively from <strong data-start=\"1195\" data-end=\"1216\">Rango Electronics</strong>.</p>\n<p>This Eva Pure water heater comes with a load capacity of 30 liters. It provides you with a steady supply of hot water whenever you need it and it takes time to heat water to 25-30 minutes. Also, this heater has a 2000W power capacity that ensures quick heating of water. It is perfect for large families or anyone who loves warm water.</p>",
