    "description": "<h2 data-start=\"141\" data-end=\"212\">❄️ <strong data-start=\"147\" data-end=\"212\">AC Repair Service in Bangladesh – Fast, Reliable &amp; Affordable</strong></h2>\n<p data-start=\"214\" data-end=\"468\">When your air conditioner stops cooling or makes unusual noise, it’s time to call the experts! <strong data-start=\"309\" data-end=\"330\">Rango Electronics</strong> offers <strong data-start=\"338\" data-end=\"373\">professional AC repair services</strong> all over Bangladesh — ensuring quick diagnosis, expert fixing, and long-lasting performance.</p>\n<p data-start=\"470\" data-end=\"744\">Our skilled technicians handle <strong data-start=\"501\" data-end=\"521\">all types of ACs</strong>, including <strong data-start=\"533\" data-end=\"571\">split, window, and inverter models</strong>, using advanced tools and genuine spare parts. We’re committed to delivering fast, affordable, and trustworthy repair solutions for homes, offices, and commercial spaces.</p>\n<hr data-start=\"746\" data-end=\"749\" />\n<h3 data-start=\"751\" data-end=\"793\">???? <strong data-start=\"758\" data-end=\"793\">Our AC Repair Services Include:</strong></h3>\n<ul data-start=\"794\" data-end=\"1438\">\n<li data-start=\"794\" data-end=\"879\">\n<p data-start=\"796\" data-end=\"879\"><strong data-start=\"796\" data-end=\"823\">Cooling Problem Fixing:</strong> Solving low cooling or no cooling issues efficiently.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"880\" data-end=\"967\">\n<p data-start=\"882\" data-end=\"967\"><strong data-start=\"882\" data-end=\"905\">Gas Leakage Repair:</strong> Detecting and sealing refrigerant leaks to restore cooling.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"968\" data-end=\"1061\">\n<p data-start=\"970\" data-end=\"1061\"><strong data-start=\"970\" data-end=\"1006\">Compressor Repair &amp; Replacement:</strong> Ensuring smooth and quiet operation of your AC unit.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1062\" data-end=\"1157\">\n<p data-start=\"1064\" data-end=\"1157\"><strong data-start=\"1064\" data-end=\"1098\">PCB &amp; Electrical Fault Repair:</strong> Fixing power supply, wiring, and circuit board problems.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1158\" data-end=\"1248\">\n<p data-start=\"1160\" data-end=\"1248\"><strong data-start=\"1160\" data-end=\"1183\">Fan &amp; Motor Repair:</strong> Repairing faulty indoor/outdoor fan motors for better airflow.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1249\" data-end=\"1340\">\n<p data-start=\"1251\" data-end=\"1340\"><strong data-start=\"1251\" data-end=\"1273\">Water Leakage Fix:</strong> Cleaning and unclogging drainage systems to stop water dripping.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1341\" data-end=\"1438\">\n<p data-start=\"1343\" data-end=\"1438\"><strong data-start=\"1343\" data-end=\"1370\">Remote &amp; Sensor Issues:</strong> Troubleshooting control system problems for accurate performance.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr data-start=\"1440\" data-end=\"1443\" />\n<h3 data-start=\"1445\" data-end=\"1499\">???? <strong data-start=\"1452\" data-end=\"1499\">Why Choose Rango Electronics for AC Repair?</strong></h3>\n<p data-start=\"1500\" data-end=\"1776\">✅ Expert &amp; Certified Technicians<br data-start=\"1532\" data-end=\"1535\" />✅ Genuine Spare Parts<br data-start=\"1556\" data-end=\"1559\" />✅ Quick Home Service<br data-start=\"1579\" data-end=\"1582\" />✅ Transparent Pricing – No Hidden Charges<br data-start=\"1623\" data-end=\"1626\" />✅ Service Warranty Available<br data-start=\"1654\" data-end=\"1657\" />✅ Works with All Major Brands: Gree, Haier, LG, Samsung, Walton, Midea, General, Sharp, Hitachi, Panasonic, and more.</p>\n<hr data-start=\"1778\" data-end=\"1781\" />\n<h3 data-start=\"1783\" data-end=\"1811\">???? <strong data-start=\"1790\" data-end=\"1811\">Service Coverage:</strong></h3>\n<p data-start=\"1812\" data-end=\"1942\">We offer <strong data-start=\"1821\" data-end=\"1848\">AC repair and servicing</strong> across <strong data-start=\"1856\" data-end=\"1940\">Dhaka, Chattogram, Sylhet, Khulna, Rajshahi, and all major cities in Bangladesh.</strong></p>\n<hr data-start=\"1944\" data-end=\"1947\" />\n<h3 data-start=\"1949\" data-end=\"1986\">???? <strong data-start=\"1956\" data-end=\"1986\">Book Your AC Repair Today!</strong></h3>\n<p data-start=\"1987\" data-end=\"2132\">Don’t let heat ruin your comfort! Get your AC repaired by trusted professionals.<br data-start=\"2067\" data-end=\"2070\" />Call us today or book online to enjoy cool, clean air again.</p>\n<p data-start=\"1987\" data-end=\"2132\">???? <strong data-start=\"2170\" data-end=\"2182\">Website:</strong> <a class=\"decorated-link cursor-pointer\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"2183\" data-end=\"2239\">www.rangoelectronics.com</a><br data-start=\"2239\" data-end=\"2242\" />???? <strong data-start=\"2245\" data-end=\"2311\">Rango Electronics – Your Trusted Cooling Partner in Bangladesh</strong></p>",
