    "description": "<h3 data-start=\"96\" data-end=\"143\">Dewanco Water Heater / Geyser &#8211; 45 Liters</h3>\n<p data-start=\"145\" data-end=\"401\">Experience uninterrupted hot water with the <strong data-start=\"189\" data-end=\"234\">Dewanco <a href=\"/category/geyser-water-heaters\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span style=\"color: #0000ff\">Water Heater</span></a>/ Geyser &#8211; 45 Liters</strong>, designed for larger households. Its robust construction and energy-efficient design make it perfect for daily use, providing comfort and convenience for your home.</p>\n<h4 data-start=\"403\" data-end=\"422\">Key Features</h4>\n<ul data-start=\"423\" data-end=\"987\">\n<li data-start=\"423\" data-end=\"488\">\n<p data-start=\"425\" data-end=\"488\"><strong data-start=\"425\" data-end=\"438\">Capacity:</strong> 45 Liters – ideal for medium to large families.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"489\" data-end=\"597\">\n<p data-start=\"491\" data-end=\"597\"><strong data-start=\"491\" data-end=\"510\">Durable &amp; Safe:</strong> Thick inner tank and automatic thermal cut-off ensure reliable and secure operation.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"598\" data-end=\"669\">\n<p data-start=\"600\" data-end=\"669\"><strong data-start=\"600\" data-end=\"621\">Energy Efficient:</strong> Heats water quickly while saving electricity.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"670\" data-end=\"746\">\n<p data-start=\"672\" data-end=\"746\"><strong data-start=\"672\" data-end=\"697\">Fireproof Insulation:</strong> Protects against heat loss and ensures safety.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"747\" data-end=\"831\">\n<p data-start=\"749\" data-end=\"831\"><strong data-start=\"749\" data-end=\"778\">Italian Heating Elements:</strong> Long-lasting performance for consistent hot water.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"832\" data-end=\"902\">\n<p data-start=\"834\" data-end=\"902\"><strong data-start=\"834\" data-end=\"856\">Easy Installation:</strong> Floor-type design suitable for most spaces.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"903\" data-end=\"987\">\n<p data-start=\"905\" data-end=\"987\"><strong data-start=\"905\" data-end=\"918\">Warranty:</strong> 5 years on parts and inner tank with reliable after-sales service.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 data-start=\"989\" data-end=\"1015\">Why Choose Dewanco?</h4>\n<p data-start=\"1016\" data-end=\"1333\">Dewanco water heaters are known for <strong data-start=\"1052\" data-end=\"1090\">durability, efficiency, and safety</strong>. The 45-liter capacity ensures that your family enjoys continuous hot water for showers, kitchen use, and other household needs. With energy-saving technology and premium materials, this geyser offers long-lasting comfort and peace of mind.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p data-start=\"1335\" data-end=\"1444\">Upgrade your home with the <strong data-start=\"1362\" data-end=\"1399\">Dewanco 45L Water Heater / Geyser</strong> and enjoy hassle-free hot water every day.</p>",
