    "description": "<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1caffc0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-wd_title\" data-id=\"1caffc0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"wd_title.default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n<div class=\"title-wrapper set-mb-s reset-last-child wd-title-color-default wd-title-style-default wd-title-size-default text-left\">\n<div class=\"liner-continer\">\n<h3>Description</h3>\n<p class=\"woodmart-title-container title wd-fontsize-l\">Whirlpool Magicook 20L Classic (Solo) Microwave Oven is available at Rango Electronics in Bangladesh. Please visit the official Page for more information. Rango Electronics is the Distributor of Whirlpool in Bangladesh. Get yours now from Rango Electronics and enjoy our own Quick EMI payment facilities.</p>\n</div>\n<ul>\n<li>Auto-cook menu</li>\n<li>LED display</li>\n<li>Auto Clean</li>\n<li>Defrost function,</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e24b901 wd-single-content elementor-widget elementor-widget-wd_single_product_content\" data-id=\"e24b901\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"wd_single_product_content.default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n<h3><span class=\"head-yel\">AUTO-COOK MENUS</span></h3>\n<p><img class=\" lazyloaded\" src=\"https://transcom-storage.s3.amazonaws.com/2eb459e3-036e-4c2f-ac2a-2a2039c4a351/ddd04b35-531a-4fe0-bc10-d4103d6bf2a6/old-cdn-contents/Content/Images/uploaded/June%202020/WP%20new%20MWO/Capture212.PNG\" alt=\"\" data-src=\"https://transcom-storage.s3.amazonaws.com/2eb459e3-036e-4c2f-ac2a-2a2039c4a351/ddd04b35-531a-4fe0-bc10-d4103d6bf2a6/old-cdn-contents/Content/Images/uploaded/June%202020/WP%20new%20MWO/Capture212.PNG\" /></p>\n<p>Auto Cook recipe menus to delight your family.</p>\n<p><img class=\" lazyloaded\" src=\"https://transcom-storage.s3.amazonaws.com/2eb459e3-036e-4c2f-ac2a-2a2039c4a351/ddd04b35-531a-4fe0-bc10-d4103d6bf2a6/old-cdn-contents/Content/Images/uploaded/white%20background.png\" alt=\"\" data-src=\"https://transcom-storage.s3.amazonaws.com/2eb459e3-036e-4c2f-ac2a-2a2039c4a351/ddd04b35-531a-4fe0-bc10-d4103d6bf2a6/old-cdn-contents/Content/Images/uploaded/white%20background.png\" /></p>\n<h3>5 POWER LEVELS</h3>\n<p><img class=\" lazyloaded\" src=\"https://transcom-storage.s3.amazonaws.com/2eb459e3-036e-4c2f-ac2a-2a2039c4a351/ddd04b35-531a-4fe0-bc10-d4103d6bf2a6/old-cdn-contents/Content/Images/uploaded/June%202020/WP%20new%20MWO/50047_f4.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"272\" height=\"272\" data-src=\"https://transcom-storage.s3.amazonaws.com/2eb459e3-036e-4c2f-ac2a-2a2039c4a351/ddd04b35-531a-4fe0-bc10-d4103d6bf2a6/old-cdn-contents/Content/Images/uploaded/June%202020/WP%20new%20MWO/50047_f4.jpg\" /></p>\n<p>Choose from 5 different power levels to set your cooking time.</p>\n<p><img class=\" lazyloaded\" src=\"https://transcom-storage.s3.amazonaws.com/2eb459e3-036e-4c2f-ac2a-2a2039c4a351/ddd04b35-531a-4fe0-bc10-d4103d6bf2a6/old-cdn-contents/Content/Images/uploaded/white%20background.png\" alt=\"\" data-src=\"https://transcom-storage.s3.amazonaws.com/2eb459e3-036e-4c2f-ac2a-2a2039c4a351/ddd04b35-531a-4fe0-bc10-d4103d6bf2a6/old-cdn-contents/Content/Images/uploaded/white%20background.png\" /></p>\n<p><strong>LED Display </strong></p>\n<p><img class=\" lazyloaded\" src=\"https://transcom-storage.s3.amazonaws.com/2eb459e3-036e-4c2f-ac2a-2a2039c4a351/ddd04b35-531a-4fe0-bc10-d4103d6bf2a6/old-cdn-contents/Content/Images/uploaded/June%202020/WP%20new%20MWO/MAGICOOK_PRO20SE_WebBanner-06.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"206\" height=\"206\" data-src=\"https://transcom-storage.s3.amazonaws.com/2eb459e3-036e-4c2f-ac2a-2a2039c4a351/ddd04b35-531a-4fe0-bc10-d4103d6bf2a6/old-cdn-contents/Content/Images/uploaded/June%202020/WP%20new%20MWO/MAGICOOK_PRO20SE_WebBanner-06.jpg\" /></p>\n<p><img class=\" ls-is-cached lazyloaded\" src=\"https://transcom-storage.s3.amazonaws.com/2eb459e3-036e-4c2f-ac2a-2a2039c4a351/ddd04b35-531a-4fe0-bc10-d4103d6bf2a6/old-cdn-contents/Content/Images/uploaded/white%20background.png\" alt=\"\" data-src=\"https://transcom-storage.s3.amazonaws.com/2eb459e3-036e-4c2f-ac2a-2a2039c4a351/ddd04b35-531a-4fe0-bc10-d4103d6bf2a6/old-cdn-contents/Content/Images/uploaded/white%20background.png\" /></p>\n<p><strong>Auto Clean</strong></p>\n<p><img class=\" lazyloaded\" src=\"https://transcom-storage.s3.amazonaws.com/2eb459e3-036e-4c2f-ac2a-2a2039c4a351/ddd04b35-531a-4fe0-bc10-d4103d6bf2a6/old-cdn-contents/Content/Images/uploaded/June%202020/WP%20new%20MWO/Capture1.PNG\" alt=\"\" width=\"234\" height=\"232\" data-src=\"https://transcom-storage.s3.amazonaws.com/2eb459e3-036e-4c2f-ac2a-2a2039c4a351/ddd04b35-531a-4fe0-bc10-d4103d6bf2a6/old-cdn-contents/Content/Images/uploaded/June%202020/WP%20new%20MWO/Capture1.PNG\" /></p>\n<p>Forget the hassle of the messy cavity. Now clean your microwave oven with the touch of a button.</p>\n</div>\n</div>",
