    "description": "<div class=\"block-header\">\n<div class=\"o_g parameterList\">\n<div class=\"o_u o_df_1-3 o_xs_2-2 \">\n<h2 class=\"parameterListtitle\">General Specifications</h2>\n</div>\n<div class=\"o_u o_g o_df_2-3 o_xs_2-2 parameterListdetails\">\n<ul>\n<li>\n<div class=\"o_u o_df_1-2 o_xs_2-2 leftname\">Type:Chest Freezer</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div class=\"o_u o_df_1-2 o_xs_2-2 leftname\">Door Finish:Stylish Textured Metal</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div class=\"o_u o_df_1-2 o_xs_2-2 leftname\">Colour:Premium Ash Blue</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div class=\"o_u o_df_1-2 o_xs_2-2 leftname\">Total Gross Capacity (L):251L</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div class=\"o_u o_df_1-2 o_xs_2-2 leftname\">Internal Light:Yes</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div class=\"o_u o_df_1-2 o_xs_2-2 leftname\">Sliding Glass:No</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div class=\"o_u o_df_1-2 o_xs_2-2 leftname\">Net Weight (kg):45</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div class=\"o_u o_df_1-2 o_xs_2-2 leftname\">Gross Weight (kg):51</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div class=\"o_u o_df_1-2 o_xs_2-2 leftname\">Handle:Recessed handle</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div class=\"o_u o_df_1-2 o_xs_2-2 leftname\">Climate Class:T</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div class=\"o_u o_df_1-2 o_xs_2-2 leftname\">Compressor Type:Fix</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div class=\"o_u o_df_1-2 o_xs_2-2 leftname\">Refrigerant:R600a</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div class=\"o_u o_df_1-2 o_xs_2-2 leftname\">Dimension (WxDxH) (mm):940*620*880</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div class=\"o_u o_df_1-2 o_xs_2-2 leftname\">Voltage Range:160V~275V</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div class=\"o_u o_df_1-2 o_xs_2-2 leftname\">Convertible Mode:Yes (Freezer to Fridge)</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div class=\"o_u o_df_1-2 o_xs_2-2 leftname\">Hinge:Balanced Hinge</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div class=\"o_u o_df_1-2 o_xs_2-2 leftname\">Lock &amp; Key:No</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div class=\"o_u o_df_1-2 o_xs_2-2 leftname\">Temperature Alarm:Yes</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div class=\"o_u o_df_1-2 o_xs_2-2 leftname\">Power-on Light:Yes</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div class=\"o_u o_df_1-2 o_xs_2-2 leftname\">Basket:1</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div class=\"o_u o_df_1-2 o_xs_2-2 leftname\">Wheel:Yes</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"o_g parameterList\">\n<div class=\"o_u o_df_1-3 o_xs_2-2 \">\n<h2 class=\"parameterListtitle\">Warranty</h2>\n</div>\n<div class=\"o_u o_g o_df_2-3 o_xs_2-2 parameterListdetails\">\n<ul>\n<li>\n<div class=\"o_u o_df_1-2 o_xs_2-2 leftname\">Compressor:10 Years</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div class=\"o_u o_df_1-2 o_xs_2-2 leftname\">Parts and Service:2 Years</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"block-wrapper\">\n<div class=\"block-content block-description\">\n<h3><b>HAIER HCF-290 251L CHEST FREEZER</b></h3>\n<p>The HAIER HCF-290 251L CHEST FREEZER is a reliable and spacious freezer that is perfect for storing large quantities of food items. Its iconic chest design is complemented by a sleek metal door finish which adds to its aesthetic appeal. The freezer has a total gross capacity of 251L and comes equipped with an internal light, making it easy to see what&#8217;s inside without having to open the lid. The freezer does not have a sliding glass but features a handle on the outside for easy access. It has a net weight of 45 kg and a gross weight of 51 kg, making it sturdy and durable. The freezer has a balanced hinge and a lock &amp; key for added security. The control panel is located on the freezer and comes with a temperature alarm and power-on light. The freezer also has one basket and wheels, making it easy to move around when needed. The freezer is powered by a fixed compressor type and uses R600a refrigerant. It has a climate class of T and can function effectively in a voltage range of 160V &#8211; 260V. The dimensions of the freezer are 920*745*845 mm, which makes it compact enough to fit into most spaces. The HAIER HCF-290 251L CHEST FREEZER has a 10-year warranty on the compressor and a 2-year warranty on parts and services, ensuring peace of mind for its users. The large selection of <a href=\"/category/refrigeratorchest-freezer/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Refrigerator</a> available .</p>\n</div>\n</div>",
