    "description": "<section id=\"description\" class=\"description bg-white m-tb-15\">\n<div class=\"section-head\">\n<h2>Description</h2>\n</div>\n<div class=\"full-description\">\n<h2>Xiaomi A Pro 65 Inch 4K UHD Smart Android Google TV</h2>\n<p>The Xiaomi <strong>A Pro</strong> 65 Inch Smart Android HD Google <a href=\"/category/smart-android-tv\" target=\"\">Television </a>Global Version raises the bar for home entertainment with its incredible features and technology. A visually striking and realistic viewing experience is achieved with the 4K UHD display, which has a resolution of 3,840 × 2,160 pixels and a smooth refresh rate of 60 Hz. The television&#8217;s built-in Google Assistant allows it to smoothly fit into smart living spaces in addition to captivating viewers with its high-resolution image. This feature increases convenience and interaction by enabling voice commands to operate the TV, search for content, and access other smart functions. Users can rapidly stream information from compatible devices straight to their television sets thanks to Chromecast&#8217;s built-in capabilities, which expands connectivity choices. Due to two speakers producing a strong 12W output, which produces immersive, high-fidelity sound quality, the audio experience is also exceptional. With its unparalleled clarity and smart functionality, the Xiaomi A Pro Smart Android HD Google Television is a versatile and sophisticated entertainment hub that improves your home entertainment experience whether you&#8217;re watching 4K content, searching the Android ecosystem for apps, or casting content from your devices.</p>\n<h3>High-resolution Display</h3>\n<p>The very tiny bezel design of the Xiaomi A Pro TV allows it to have a considerably greater screen-to-body ratio than traditional TVs. Bright colors and sharp images fill the screen when the television is switched on, creating an immersive experience.</p>\n<h3>Immersive Audio</h3>\n<p>Dolby Audio and DTS-X&#8217;s dual decoding technology provide rich sound effects that enhance the listening experience. The Xiaomi <strong>Mi A Pro</strong> also has DTS Virtual:X technology, which simulates a three-dimensional cinematic experience with an overhead dimension.</p>\n<h3>Entertainment With Google</h3>\n<p>Google TV curates movies, TV shows, and other material from your subscriptions and apps for tailored watching. With Mi A Pro TV, you may browse through your subscriptions and available material to discover new content that interests you, depending on what you&#8217;ve already viewed.</p>\n<h2>Buy Xiaomi A Pro 65 Inch 4K UHD Smart Android Google TV from Star Tech</h2>\n<p>In Bangladesh, you can get original Xiaomi A Pro 65 Inch 4K UHD Smart Google TV (Global Version) From Star Tech. We have a large collection of latest <a href=\"/category/smart-android-tv\" target=\"\">Xiaomi TV</a> to purchase. Order Online Or Visit your Nearest  Shop to get yours at lowest price. The Xiaomi A Pro 65 Inch 4K UHD Smart Google TV comes with 01 Year Parts &amp; 03 Year Panel Warranty.</p>\n<p>For warranty claims, please contact the Xiaomi distributor directly through the official customer service hotline at 01753919191.</p>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section id=\"latest-price\" class=\"latest-price bg-white m-tb-15\">\n<div class=\"section-head\"></div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</section>",
