    "description": "<section id=\"description\" class=\"description bg-white m-tb-15\">\n<div class=\"section-head\">\n<h2>Description</h2>\n</div>\n<div class=\"full-description\">\n<h2>Xiaomi A Pro 32 Inch HD Smart Android Google TV</h2>\n<p>The Xiaomi <strong>A Pro</strong> 32 Inch Smart Android Google <a href=\"/category/smart-android-tv\" target=\"\">Television </a>Global Version, with its outstanding features and cutting-edge technology, completely transforms the home entertainment experience. The television has a brilliant HD display with a resolution of 1366 x 768 pixels and a smooth 60 Hz refresh rate, providing breathtaking graphics and fluid motion for an immersive watching experience. This Smart TV goes beyond typical capabilities by incorporating Google Assistant right into the system, giving customers a hands-free and straightforward method to operate their TV, search for content, and access a variety of smart features. The addition of Chromecast improves connection by allowing consumers to easily stream content from compatible devices to their TV screens. The audio experience is similarly impressive, owing to the two speakers that generate a strong 10W output, assuring crisp and rich sound quality. Whether you&#8217;re watching your favorite shows, accessing a plethora of Android apps, or seamlessly casting content from your devices, the Xiaomi Mi A Pro Smart Android Google TV stands out as a versatile and sophisticated entertainment hub that brings the future of home viewing to your living room.</p>\n<h3>High-resolution Display</h3>\n<p>The ultra-narrow bezel design of Xiaomi <strong>Mi A Pro</strong> TV allows for a far higher screen-to-body ratio than normal TVs. When you switch on the TV, high-resolution visuals in brilliant colors cover the screen, creating an immersive experience.</p>\n<h3>Immersive Audio</h3>\n<p>Dolby Audio + DTS-X dual decoding technology creates vibrant sound effects for a more immersive listening experience. Furthermore, the DTS Virtual:X technology of Xiaomi A Pro delivers three-dimensional sound with an overhead dimension, simulating the movie experience.</p>\n<h3>Entertainment With Google</h3>\n<p>Google TV aggregates movies, programs, and other content from your applications and subscriptions for personalized viewing. Discover new things with <strong>Mi A Pro</strong> TV to watch with suggestions based on what you&#8217;ve seen and what interests you from your subscriptions and accessible content.</p>\n<h2>Buy Xiaomi A Pro 32 Inch Smart Android Google TV from Star Tech</h2>\n<p>In Bangladesh, you can get original Xiaomi A Pro 32 Inch Smart Android Google TV From Star Tech. We have a large collection of latest <a href=\"/category/smart-android-tv\" target=\"\">Xiaomi TV</a> to purchase. Order Online Or Visit your Nearest Shop to get yours at lowest price. The Xiaomi A Pro 32 Inch Smart Google TV comes with 01 Year Parts &amp; 03 Year Panel Warranty.</p>\n<p>For warranty claims, please contact the Xiaomi distributor directly through the official customer service hotline at 01753919191.</p>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section id=\"latest-price\" class=\"latest-price bg-white m-tb-15\">\n<div class=\"section-head\"></div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</section>",
