    "description": "<section id=\"description\" class=\"description bg-white m-tb-15\">\n<div class=\"section-head\">\n<h2>Description</h2>\n</div>\n<div class=\"full-description\">\n<h2>Xiaomi A Pro 55 Inch 4K UHD Smart Android Google TV</h2>\n<p>The Xiaomi <strong>A Pro</strong> 55 Inch Smart Android HD Google <a href=\"/category/smart-android-tv\" target=\"\">Television </a>Global Version, With its amazing features and technology, it elevates the standard for home entertainment. The 4K UHD display has a resolution of 3,840 × 2,160 pixels and a smooth 60 Hz refresh rate, resulting in a visually stunning and realistic viewing experience. The television not only captivates with its high-resolution image, but it also seamlessly integrates into smart living spaces, due to Google Assistant built-in. This feature allows users to control the TV, search for content, and access a number of smart features with voice commands, boosting convenience and interactivity. Chromecast&#8217;s built-in capability broadens connectivity options, allowing users to quickly stream content from compatible devices directly to their television sets. The audio experience is also outstanding, thanks to two speakers that create a powerful 12W output, This results in immersive, high-fidelity sound quality. Whether you&#8217;re watching 4K content, exploring the Android ecosystem for apps, or casting content from your devices, the Xiaomi Mi A Pro Smart Android HD Google Television is a versatile and sophisticated entertainment hub that enhances your home entertainment experience with unparalleled clarity and smart functionality.</p>\n<h3>High-resolution Display</h3>\n<p>Compared to conventional TVs, the Xiaomi Mi A Pro TV has a far higher screen-to-body ratio thanks to its very thin bezel design. An immersive experience is provided by the high-resolution visuals and brilliant colors that cover the screen when the television is turned on.</p>\n<h3>Immersive Audio</h3>\n<p>Rich sound effects are produced by the dual decoding technologies of Dolby Audio and DTS-X, making for a more engaging listening experience. Additionally, the Xiaomi <strong>Mi A Pro</strong> has DTS Virtual:X technology, which creates three-dimensional sound with an overhead dimension to mimic a movie experience.</p>\n<h3>Entertainment With Google</h3>\n<p>For personalized viewing, Google TV selects movies, series, and other content from your subscriptions and applications. With Mi A Pro TV, you can find new stuff to watch based on what you&#8217;ve watched and what piques your interest from your subscriptions and accessible content.</p>\n<h2>Buy Xiaomi A Pro 55 Inch 4K UHD Smart Android Google TV from Star Tech</h2>\n<p>In Bangladesh, you can get original Xiaomi A Pro 55 Inch 4K UHD Smart Android Google TV (Global Version) (Global Version) From Star Tech. We have a large collection of latest <a href=\"/category/smart-android-tv\" target=\"\">Xiaomi TV</a> to purchase. Order Online Or Visit your Nearest Shop to get yours at lowest price. The Xiaomi A Pro 55 Inch 4K UHD Smart Google TV comes with 01 Year Parts &amp; 03 Year Panel Warranty.</p>\n<p>For warranty claims, please contact the Xiaomi distributor directly through the official customer service hotline at 01753919191.</p>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section id=\"latest-price\" class=\"latest-price bg-white m-tb-15\">\n<div class=\"section-head\"></div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</section>",
