    "description": "<section id=\"description\" class=\"description bg-white m-tb-15\">\n<div class=\"section-head\">\n<h2>Description</h2>\n</div>\n<div class=\"full-description\">\n<h2>Xiaomi A 43 Inch FHD Smart Android Google TV</h2>\n<p>The <strong>Xiaomi A 43 Inch FHD Smart Android Google TV</strong> is designed to elevate your home entertainment experience with its stunning visuals and smart features. This sleek and stylish TV boasts a Full HD display that delivers crisp and vibrant images, making every scene come to life. The ultra-thin bezels provide an immersive viewing experience, while the metallic frame adds a touch of elegance to any room. Powered by Google TV, this smart TV offers seamless access to a wide range of apps, including Disney Plus Hotstar, Zee5, and more, ensuring you never run out of content to watch.</p>\n<h3>Control your TV with Google Voice Assistant</h3>\n<p>The Xiaomi A 43 Inch FHD Smart Android Google TV is packed with smart features that enhance your viewing experience. Powered by Google TV, it offers seamless access to a vast array of apps and streaming services, ensuring you always have something to watch. One of the standout features is the built-in Google Voice Assistant support, which allows you to control your television with simple voice commands. Whether you want to search for your favorite shows, adjust the volume, or control other smart home devices, the Google Voice Assistant makes it effortless. Just say &#8220;OK Google&#8221; to activate the assistant and enjoy hands-free control of your TV. This smart television also supports Chromecast, enabling you to stream content directly from your smartphone or tablet, making it a versatile addition to any modern home.</p>\n<h3>Superior Audio and User-Friendly Design</h3>\n<p>Experience clear and powerful sound with the Xiaomi A 43 Inch FHD Smart Android Google TV&#8217;s 2x 10W speakers, enhanced by Dolby Audio technology. This ensures that every dialogue and sound effect is delivered with precision and depth. The TV also features a Kids Profile, allowing parents to create a safe and personalized viewing environment for their children. With its user-friendly interface and smart recommendations, the Xiaomi A 43 Inch FHD Smart Android Google TV makes it easy to discover new content and enjoy a tailored viewing experience.</p>\n<h2>Buy Xiaomi A 43 Inch FHD Smart Android Google TV from Star Tech</h2>\n<p>In Bangladesh, you can get original <strong>Xiaomi A 43 Inch FHD Smart Android Google TV (Global Version)</strong> From Star Tech. We have a large collection of latest <a href=\"/category/smart-android-tv\">Xiaomi TV</a> to purchase. Order Online Or Visit your Nearest Shop to get yours at lowest price. The Xiaomi A 43 Inch FHD Smart Android Google TV (Global Version) comes with 01 Year Parts &amp; 03 Year Panel Warranty.</p>\n<p>For warranty claims, please contact the Xiaomi distributor directly through the official customer service hotline at 01753919191.</p>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section id=\"latest-price\" class=\"latest-price bg-white m-tb-15\">\n<div class=\"section-head\"></div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</section>",
